[[Professor]] Rhizome (right before the Cure)
* Stop right there! What you are looking at is the intellectual property of Omnichannel!
* [[Flacono]] level 33, [[Fancair]] level 33
* You might be able to defeat me, but you'll never beat the patent lawyers.

Email 1: Researcher 1 to Dr. Lee
* E-mail from Researcher 1: 'Dr. Lee, I've been analyzing the virus samples, and I think we should try a different strain. It might trigger a new reaction in the antibodies.'

Email 2: Researcher 2 to Dr. Lee
* Note from Researcher 2: 'Dr. Lee, I've found a potential combination of enzymes and antibodies that could slow down the mutation rate. I'm running simulations now.'

Email 3: Researcher 2 to Dr. Lee
* Simulation results from Researcher 2: 'The enzyme-antibody combination shows promising results. We might have a cure on our hands.'

Email 6: Enforcer to Dr. Lee
* E-mail from Enforcer: 'Dr. Lee, we have reason to believe that you have been conducting unauthorized research. We are at your location and require you to come with us.'

Email 7: Dr. Lee to Dr. Chen, Mentor
* E-mail from Dr. Lee to Dr. Chen, Mentor: 'They are destroying my door, they want to arrest me because of unauthorized research. I can't let them take this away from me. This is a breakthrough, a real cure. I need to share it with the world.'

Email 8: Researcher 1 to Dr. Lee
* E-mail from Researcher 1: 'Dr. Lee, I've managed to isolate a new strain of the virus that seems susceptible to our current treatments. However, I'm concerned about the security implications of this discovery. We need to be extra cautious about who knows about this.'

Email 9: Enforcer to Dr. Lee
* E-mail from Enforcer: 'Dr Lee, we have received intelligence indicating that you're conducting unauthorized research within the company. We have reason to believe that your work poses a significant threat to our organization. You're hereby ordered to cease all research immediately and report to the security office.'

Email 10: Mysterious Informant to Dr. Lee
* E-mail from Mysterious Informant: 'There are people who want to see you fail. They will stop at nothing to destroy your work. Be careful.'

Email 11: Robot Assistant to Dr. Lee
* E-mail from Robot Assistant: 'I have detected unauthorized access to your research files. Please investigate immediately.'

